{
  "id": "EST.1",
  "number": "1",
  "bookId": "EST",
  "reference": "Eseza 1",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Bayibuli Entukuvu, Endagaano Enkadde nʼEndagaano Empya ekwatiddwa ku katambi™ Obwannannyini© 1984, 1986, 1993, 2014 bwa Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open Luganda Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 1984, 1986, 1993, 2014 by Biblica, Inc. \"Biblica\" Linnya ery'obwannannyini eryawandiisibwa Biblica mu Amerika era nga balina n'ekkakkalabozo, Inc. Bwaweebwa olukusa okulikozesa. \"Biblica\" is a trademark registered in the United States Patent and Trademark Office by Biblica, Inc. Used with permission.",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "1",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EST 1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "1",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nnabagereka Vasuti Aggyibwa ku Bukulu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kino kye kyabaawo ku mirembe gya Akaswero, eyafuga amasaza kikumi mu abiri mu musanvu (127) okuva e Buyindi okutuuka e Buwesiyopya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kiseera ekyo Kabaka Akaswero we yafugira mu lubiri e Susani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu mwaka ogwokusatu ogw'obufuzi bwe, yagabula abakungu n'abaami be abakulu embaga. Abaduumizi ba magye aga Buperusi ne Bumeedi, n'abalangira n'abakungu b'amasaza bonna baagiriko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yayolesa obugagga n'ekitiibwa n'ettendo eby'obwakabaka bwe okumala emyezi mukaaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ennaku ezo bwe zaggwaako, Kabaka n'agabula abantu bonna okuva ku asemberayo ddala okutuuka ku asingirayo ddala ekitiibwa embaga endala eyali mu luggya, mu lubiri e Susani okumala ennaku musanvu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oluggya lwalimu entimbe ez'engoye enjeru n'eza bbululu, nga zisibiddwa n'emiguwa egya linena omulungi n'olugoye olwa kakobe nga lusibiddwa n'empeta eza ffeeza ku mpagi ez'amayinja aganyirira. Waaliwo n'ebitanda",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ebya zaabu n'effeeza ku lubalaza olwaliire n'amayinja aganyirira, amamyufu, n'ameeru, n'aga kyenvu n'amaddugavu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kugabula kwa kabaka, wayini yaweerezebwa mu bikopo bya zaabu, nga buli kimu tekifanagana na kinnaakyo, ne wayini wa Kabaka yali mungi ddala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli mugenyi yanywanga nga bwe yayagala kubanga kabaka yalagira nti, \"Buli mugenyi anywe nga bw'ayagala.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Nnabagereka Vasuti naye n'agabula abakyala embaga mu lubiri lwa Kabaka Akaswero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo ku lunaku olwomusanvu, Kabaka Akaswero mu ssanyu lingi olwa wayini gwe yali anywedde, n'alagira abalaawe musanvu, abaamuweerezanga: Mekumani, ne Bizusa, ne Kalubona, ne Bigusa, ne Abagusa, ne Zesali ne Kalukasi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okugenda okuyita Nnabagereka Vasuti ajje mu maaso ge ng'atikkiddwa engule eya Nnabagereka, asobole okulaga obubalagavu bwe eri abantu n'abakungu, kubanga yali mulungi, mubalagavu okukamala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye abaweereza bwe baatuusa ekiragiro kya kabaka, Nnabagareka Vasuti n'agaana okugenda. Era ekyavaamu kabaka n'asunguwala, era obusungu bwe ne bubuubuuka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Kabaka yalina empisa ey'okwebuuzanga ku bakugu mu by'amateeka, era n'ateesa n'abasajja abagezigezi abategeera ebifa ku nsonga eyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amannya ga bakungu abo abakulu omusanvu mu bwakabaka bwe Buperusi ne Bumeedi ge gano: Kalusena, ne Sesali, ne Adumasa, ne Talusiisi, ne Meresi, ne Malusema ne Memukani. Bano be baamubeeranga ku lusegere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Kabaka n'ababuuza nti, \"Okusinziira ku mateeka, Nnabagereka Vasuti agwanidde kibonerezo ki olw'obutagondera kiragiro kya Kabaka Akaswero ekimutuusibbwako abalaawe?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Memukani n'addamu Kabaka n'abakungu nti, \"Nnabagereka Vasuti asobezza nnyo, ate si eri Kabaka yekka, naye n'eri abakungu n'abantu bonna ab'omu bitundu byonna Kabaka Akaswero by'afuga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era olw'enneeyisa Nnabagereka gye yeeyisizaamu, bwe kinaamanyibwa abakyala, nabo bajja kunyoomanga ba bbaabwe nga bagamba nti, 'Nga Kabaka Akaswero yalagira Nnabagereka Vasuti okuleetebwa gy'ali, n'ajeema.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era olunaku lwa leero abakyala bonna mu Buperusi ne Bumeedi aba bakungu abawulidde ku nneeyisa ya Nnabagereka bajjanga kweyisa mu ngeri y'emu eri abakungu ba Kabaka. Era obunyoomi wamu n'obutabanguko tebuggwengawo mu maka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noolwekyo Kabaka bw'anaasiima, awe ekiragiro, era kiwandiikibwe mu mateeka ga Buperusi ne Bumeedi agatakyuka, nti Vasuti aleme okujja nate mu maaso ga Kabaka Akaswero. Ate n'ekifo kye eky'Obwannabagereka, kiweebwe omukazi omulala amusinga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo ekiragiro kya kabaka bwe kinaabuna mu bwakabaka bwonna, abakyala bonna banassangamu ba bbaabwe ekitiibwa okuva ku wawagulu okutuukira ddala ku wawansi asembayo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo ekyo kyasanyusa nnyo Kabaka n'abakungu be, era Kabaka n'akola ng'ekiteeso kya Memukani bwe kyali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'aweereza obubaka eri ebitundu byonna eby'obwakabaka buli ssaza ebbaluwa yaayo, era buli bantu mu lulimi lwabwe nga bugamba nti buli musajja afugenga mu nnyumba ye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.1.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "EST.2",
    "number": "2",
    "bookId": "EST"
  },
